Synapse LIE's explicitly selected state-access variant applies independently
recorded MIT source edits for state access, MTP/vision state and target sampling
controls. adapters/gufo-state/sampling-edits.json identifies the exact pinned
bias/reporting replacements; the build receipt and source inventory bind their
hashes. Schema compilation and vocabulary token-mask generation remain delegated
Gufo implementation; the owned runtime/numeric ports are attributed below.
No model weights or sibling-project source are imported by this recipe.

The owned C17 dense sampling implementation in src/sampling.c is a port of
official src/core/sampling.cpp at f783fedb9bea2ec7de941f6da4e02f4a4596b29e.
Copyright (c) 2026 gufo contributors; MIT, with gufo-LICENSE retained here.
The native canonical benchmark workload/protocol port in tools/native/gufo_workload.c
and tools/native/http_curve.c uses the same independently fetched pin and license.
gufo-bench-source.json records its source hash, scope and offline test goldens.
adapters/gufo-state/dense-sampling-edits.json identifies the conditional provider
integration. C17 owns dense selection and random draws.
The request-history implementation in src/sampling_history.c follows the same
independently pinned Gufo semantics for prompt repetition and committed-token
counts, with this notice and license retained. The exact conditional integration
is recorded in adapters/gufo-state/history-sampling-edits.json. C17 owns this
bookkeeping. The attributed src/sampling_distribution.c port follows official
src/core/sampling.cpp and src/models/qwen38_flash_next/mtp_sampling.hpp at the
same pin, including exact rounding and draw order. Its conditional integration
is recorded in adapters/gufo-state/distribution-sampling-edits.json. C17 owns
ordered/compact normalization, residual correction and host discrete proposal/
verification arithmetic. Vector storage/deep copies, schema/primitive predicates, vocabulary trie/cache,
entropy acquisition, deferred draws, speculative controller and GPU-resident
numerical kernels remain
transitional Gufo responsibilities.

The owned C17 src/grammar.c byte-runtime and mask-application port follows
src/core/json_constraint.cpp and src/core/sampling.cpp at the same official pin.
Copyright (c) 2026 gufo contributors; MIT, with gufo-LICENSE retained. Exact
integration is recorded in adapters/gufo-state/grammar-runtime-edits.json.
C17 owns rule expansion, byte branching, stack/lexeme ordering/deduplication,
completion/canonical snapshots and mask application. Schema compilation,
primitive lexical/regex predicates and vocabulary trie/cache algorithms remain
upstream; their callback/storage bridge does not reimplement those algorithms.

The attributed C17 src/grammar_number.c exact-decimal algorithm port follows
src/core/json_schema_lexeme.cpp at the same independently fetched official pin.
Copyright (c) 2026 gufo contributors; MIT, with gufo-LICENSE retained. Exact
integration is recorded in adapters/gufo-state/grammar-number-edits.json.
C17 owns canonical decimal parsing/comparison, long division/product, numeric
bound/grid policy and prefix checking, integer multiple reduction and exact LCM.
The adapter supplies JSON value conversion/representability and exception glue.
String/regex/schema compilation and vocabulary trie/cache remain upstream.

The attributed C17 src/grammar_regex.c and src/grammar_string.c ports follow
src/core/json_schema_regex.cpp and src/core/json_schema_lexeme.cpp at the same
official pin. Copyright (c) 2026 gufo contributors; MIT, gufo-LICENSE retained.
Exact integration is in grammar-regex-edits.json and grammar-string-edits.json.
C17 owns copied Unicode-DFA graph construction/distances/pruning/range and length
queries, Brent cycle skipping, string UTF8/JSON escape/surrogate/pending/count
runtime, mask-key canonicalization and bounded whitespace. JSON/regex compilation
and vocabulary trie/transition/cache remain upstream; storage/exception glue
in gufo_grammar_regex.hpp and gufo_grammar_string.hpp performs no runtime algorithm.

The attributed C17 src/grammar_vocabulary.c trie/masking/cache port follows
src/core/json_constraint.cpp and .hpp from the same independently acquired
immutable official Gufo f783fedb pin under MIT (retained gufo-LICENSE).
Exact integration is in adapters/gufo-state/grammar-vocabulary-edits.json.
C17 owns copied token/trie storage, bounded iterative traversal, exact state
interning and canonical-state mask-cache lookup/eviction/publication. Snapshot
clone/comparison/hash are in the attributed src/grammar.c port. Provider piece,
state, vector/shared_ptr lifetime, mutex and exception translation stay in
adapters/gufo_grammar_vocabulary.hpp and exact glue edits. Regex syntax/property
parsing, JSON Schema compilation and provider snapshot marshalling remain upstream.
No sibling CachyOS artifact or DS4 source is imported; host witnesses are not
new numerical GPU/performance qualification.

Regex expression/derivative/Unicode-partition/BFS compiler extraction
---------------------------------------------------------------
src/grammar_regex_compile.c, include/lie/grammar_regex_compile.h and
adapters/gufo_grammar_regex_compile.hpp are attributed ports from the same
independently fetched official Gufo f783fedb MIT pin. Exact integration is in
adapters/gufo-state/grammar-compiler-edits.json. C17 owns expression interning,
normalization/minimum widths/nullable contexts, iterative memoized derivatives,
Unicode membership partitioning and BFS graph construction. The glue retains
syntax/assertion expansion, ICU property/full-set identity, scalar range copying
and exception translation; JSON Schema compilation remains upstream. No sibling
CachyOS or DS4 code/artifact is imported. Host comparisons do not qualify a new
original-weight GPU/runtime/performance build.
